{"name":"Emperor’s Robe","hex":"#99959d","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"emperor","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The male monarch or ruler of an empire.","Any monarch ruling an empire, irrespective of gender, with \"empress\" contrasting to mean the consort of an emperor."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/emperor"},{"term":"robe","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A long loose outer garment, often signifying honorary stature.","The skin of an animal, especially the bison, dressed with the fur on, and used as a wrap."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To clothe; to dress.","To put on official vestments."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/robe"}],"entries":[{"title":"Robe","blocks":[{"text":"A robe is a loose-fitting outer garment. Unlike garments described as capes or cloaks, robes usually have sleeves. The English word robe derives from Middle English robe (\"garment\"), borrowed from Old French robe, itself taken from the Frankish word *rouba, and is related to the word rob."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/LongPao.JPG/330px-LongPao.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Robe"},{"title":"Emperor","blocks":[{"text":"An emperor is the (male) ruler of an empire. Empress, the female equivalent, may indicate an emperor's wife, mother/grandmother, or a woman who rules in her own right and name. Emperors are generally recognised to be of the highest monarchic honour and rank, surpassing kings. In Europe, the title of Emperor has been used since the Middle Ages, considered in those times equal or almost equal in dignity to that of Pope due to the latter's position as visible head of the Church and spiritual leader of the Catholic part of Western Europe. The emperor of Japan is the only currently reigning monarch whose title is translated into English as \"Emperor\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/61/Emperor_Naruhito_and_Empress_Masako_20190515.jpg/330px-Emperor_Naruhito_and_Empress_Masako_20190515.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Daggeru.jpg/500px-Daggeru.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Daggeru.jpg/500px-Daggeru.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Academic robes","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADaggeru.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Angarkha.jpg/500px-Angarkha.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Angarkha.jpg/1280px-Angarkha.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Angarkha.jpg/500px-Angarkha.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An Indian Angarkha","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAngarkha.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/White_Swan_in_a_Buffalo_Robe_%28387c80a81fa74a7e9854f3f5f4ca5675%29_%28cropped%29.tif/lossy-page1-500px-White_Swan_in_a_Buffalo_Robe_%28387c80a81fa74a7e9854f3f5f4ca5675%29_%28cropped%29.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/White_Swan_in_a_Buffalo_Robe_%28387c80a81fa74a7e9854f3f5f4ca5675%29_%28cropped%29.tif/lossy-page1-1280px-White_Swan_in_a_Buffalo_Robe_%28387c80a81fa74a7e9854f3f5f4ca5675%29_%28cropped%29.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/co